    "text": "To ask a yes-no question, add `-mY` to the word you ask about, with no space: *-my* after a back vowel, *-mi* after a front one. *Sen ýadawmy?* (Are you tired?), *Bu täzemi?* (Is this new?)",
    "see": "gp-question-my"
  },
